{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42515","headline":"从幸秦川赋鸷兽诗 · 李浩弼","name":"从幸秦川赋鸷兽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩下年年自寝讹，生灵餐尽意如何。\n爪牙衆後民随减，溪壑深来骨已多。\n天子纪纲犹被弄，客人穷独固难过。\n长途莫怪无人迹，尽被山王棱杀他。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李浩弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}